# What stays out of the image's copy of the framework (/opt/quarto-livery-decks).
.git
.github
conda-env/
# The host's rendered decks and caches: outputs anchored one level under docs/, so the
# tracked assets under docs/common/ (every livery's template.pptx) are never matched.
docs/*/*.pptx
docs/*/*.pdf
docs/*/*.html
docs/*/*-overleaf.zip
**/*_files/
**/.quarto/
**/*.quarto_ipynb
**/__pycache__/
**/_qa/
**/_site/
**/_baseline/
**/_check/
# The README's screenshots (3 MB nothing in the image reads)
docs/quickstart/screenshots/
# A livery's reference deck and its extracted media (gitignored too)
docs/common/liveries/*/reference/media/
docs/common/liveries/*/reference/*.pptx
.playwright-mcp/
*~
